## Phase 2 — photography

Build `PhotoHeader` once, then apply it:

| Screen | File | Photo | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| First run (`components/FirstRun.tsx`) | `range-bag.webp` | full-bleed, 540px tall | Logo + wordmark top-left; eyebrow "YOUR FIRST TEN BALLS"; the existing `.deal-h` headline sits over the bottom of the photo. Steps become a ruled list numbered 01/02/03. Add "No account. Nothing leaves your phone." under the CTAs. |
| Plan header (`app/page.tsx` ~1075 `.hero`) | `range-bays.webp` | 330px, `object-position: 60% 62%` | Greeting top-left, theme/glare buttons top-right on a translucent dark face; eyebrow `WEEK 1 · SESSION 2 OF 2`, title `Foundations`. |
| Session receipt | `ball-tee.webp` | 300px | Aqua "✓ LOGGED" pill, title "Session 1, done.", meta line. |
| Round tab (`components/Round.tsx`) | `course-sunset.webp` | 290px, `30% 50%` | Title "Round", sub "On-course stats, hole by hole". |
| Course management entry (Round tab) | `aerial-green.webp` | 112px-wide thumbnail on the left of a card | Links to `components/Course.tsx`. |
| Practice games (`components/Games.tsx`) | `bunker-splash.webp` | 300px, `50% 38%` | Back button on photo; each card shows "Your best: …" or "Not played yet". |
| Fixes | `iron-balls.webp` | 210px | Sub "Your miss, and the first thing to try". |

Every `<img>` gets `alt` text (it's in the source files), `decoding="async"`,
and explicit width/height to avoid layout shift. Use plain `<img>`, since this
app avoids `next/image`.

---

## Phase 3 — drawings (inline SVG, colour via tokens)

Put them in `components/illustrations/` as small React components taking
`size`. Strokes use `currentColor` (`--text` / `--text-2`), accents use
`var(--state)`.

1. **Warm-up poses**: 7 figures, one per `WARMUP` item in `lib/prep.ts`
   (same order). Path data: the `P` array in `source/Warmup.dc.html`
   (`body`, `club`, `motion`, head `hx/hy`, viewBox 0 0 120 120). Large (180px)
   in the "Now" card, 40px thumbnails in "Still to come". Add an optional
   `pose` key to `PrepItem`.
2. **Pre-shot routine steps**: 6 icons (viewBox 0 0 64 64), the `S` array in
   `source/Routine.dc.html`, shown in 64px tiles in place of the number badges.
   "STEP n" moves to an eyebrow.
3. **Chipping focus-drill diagram**: top-down ball / brush line / towel /
   flag, from `source/Log.dc.html`. Rewrite that drill's text as three short
   steps. Other areas' drills can follow the same pattern later.

---

## Phase 4 — copy

- Warm-up finished: "Loose and ready" / "All seven done. Your body will thank
  you on ball one."
- Receipt title: "Session N, done." (was "Session N logged").
- Round start CTA: "Tee off · 18 holes".
- Games intro: "One score per game, beaten next time. You against your own
  best, never a leaderboard."
- Fixes note: "This is a best guess from your answer. After a few logged
  drives, it updates from what you actually hit. A lesson still beats a table."

## Phase 5 — housekeeping

- Refresh `public/screenshot-plan.png` / `screenshot-round.png` (they still
  show the pre-Aqua green skin).
- README references `public/logo_kit/`, which doesn't exist. Fix the path or
  the text.
- `public/driver.svg`, `iron.svg`, `putter.svg`, `flag-hole.svg` are unused.
  Delete them.
- Bump version to 1.3.0 and add a Version history entry. Photo credits:
  Unsplash/Pexels licence, no attribution required; list them in About anyway.

## Done when

- [ ] All 5 bugs verified in the browser
- [ ] Each screen matches its `screens/*.jpg` in dark mode, and looks right in light mode
- [ ] Airplane mode after first load: photos still show
- [ ] `tsc`, `next build` and `npm audit` pass in CI
